#: main.cpp:34
msgid ""
"<B>Kooka</B> is a KDE2 application which provides access to scanner hardware "
"using the SANE library.<P>Kooka helps you scan, save your image in the "
"correct image format and perform <B>O</B>ptical <B>C</B>haracter "
"<B>R</B>ecognition on it,using <I>gocr</I>, Joerg Schulenburg's and friends' "
"Open Source ocr program.<P>For information on Kooka see <A HREF=http://>The "
"kooka page</A><P>"
msgstr ""

